  "content": "\n\n<h1>Chunky Offline</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fchunky-offline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/chunky-offline?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-ff5f5f?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"贊助\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/paypal-donate-ff5f5f?logo=paypal&color=blue\" alt=\"贊助\"></a></p>\n<h2>📖 描述</h2>\n<p>Chunky Offline 是 <a href=\"https://github.com/pop4959/Chunky\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chunky</a> 的附加元件／擴充功能，用於在沒有玩家線上時自動生成區塊，預設半徑為 <code>10000</code>，中心點位於 <code>0 0</code>。</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>修改設定檔：</p>\n<pre><code>/function chunky_offline:config/set {\"radius\":10000,\"x\":0,\"z\":0}</code></pre>\n<p>停用／啟用全域訊息：</p>\n<pre><code>/function chunky_offline:config/global_messages/&lt;enable | disable&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>強制啟動（僅限於您已手動取消進度時）：</p>\n<pre><code>/function chunky_offline:chunky/force_start</code></pre>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/ChunkyOffline/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>👾 錯誤與問題</h2>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題、錯誤或建議。</p>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往 Ko-Fi 贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">前往 PayPal 贊助</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器託管</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個非常耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但透過 BisectHosting，只需幾下點擊即可擁有專屬伺服器！他們提供 24/7 客服支援與快速回應，絕不讓任何問題阻礙您的腳步！感興趣嗎？我們為您準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"伺服器託管\"></p>",
